---
// Closing call to action for /learn/ articles.
---

<aside class="app-cta not-content">
  <p class="app-cta-text">
    <strong>ComicDraft</strong> formats pages, panels, dialog, captions, and SFX
    as you type, and numbers everything for you. $19.99 one-time for Mac and iPad.
  </p>
  <a class="app-cta-button" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6781109986">Download on the App Store</a>
</aside>

<style>
  .app-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
  .app-cta-text {
    flex: 1 1 18rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
  }
  .app-cta-button {
    flex: none;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .app-cta-button:hover {
    background: #0070e0;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
